                        %mrow
                          %mi M
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} M
          %p
            Further generalization to target spaces that need not be compact and moreover may be
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differentiable+stacks"} differentiable stacks
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+groupoids"} Lie groupoids
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kai+Behrend"}> Kai Behrend
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gregory+Ginot"} Gregory Ginot
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Behrang+Noohi"} Behrang Noohi
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ping+Xu"} Ping Xu
                = succeed "," do
                  %em String topology for stacks
                %strong 343
                (2012) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0712.3857"}> arxiv/0712.3857
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item?id=AST_2012__343__R1_0"} numdam:AST_2012__343__R1_0
            %li
              %p
                %em> String topology for loop stacks
                , C. R. Math. Acad. Sci. Paris,
                %strong 344
                4 (2007) 247–252
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Po+Hu"}> Po Hu
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Higher string topology on general spaces
                %strong 93
                (2006) 515-544,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1112/S0024611506015838"} doi
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.wayne.edu/~po/koszul04.ps"} ps
          %p
            On therelation between string topology and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hochschild+cohomology"} Hochschild cohomology
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Vaintrob"}> Dmitry Vaintrob
                \:
                %em The String topology BV algebra, Hochschild cohomology and the Goldman bracket on surfaces
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0702859"}> arXiv:0702859
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Manuel+Rivera"}> Manuel Rivera
                , Zhengfang Wang:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Singular Hochschild cohomology and algebraic string operations
                %strong 13
                1 (2017) 297–361 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.4171/jncg/325"}> doi;10.4171/jncg/325
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Specifically on string topology of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-spheres"} n-spheres
            (in particular on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+homology"} ordinary homology
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+loop+spaces"} free loop spaces
            of
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-spheres"} n-spheres
          %ul
            %li#CohenJonesYan04
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+L.+Cohen"}> Ralph L. Cohen
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+D.+S.+Jones"} John D. S. Jones
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The loop homology algebra of spheres and projective spaces
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Categorical Decomposition Techniques in Algebraic Topology
                %strong 215
                Birkhäuser (2004) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0210353"}> arXiv:math/0210353
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-0348-7863-0_5"} doi:10.1007/978-3-0348-7863-0_5
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luc+Menichi"}> Luc Menichi
                , Gerald Gaudens:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em String topology for spheres
                %strong 84
                (2009) 135–157 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0609304"}> arXiv:math/0609304
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://ems.press/content/serial-article-files/43186"} ems:43186
            %li
              %p
                Ricardo Cabral, Basto Rodriguez,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Geometric Approach to the String Topology of Spheres
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/CabralRodriguez-STofSpheres.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %h3#as_a_tqft_2 As a TQFT
          %p
            The interpretation of closed string topology as an
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/HQFT"} HQFT
          %ul
            %li#CohenGodin03
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+Cohen"}> Ralph Cohen
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Veronique+Godin"} Veronique Godin
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Polarized+View+of+String+Topology"} A Polarized View of String Topology
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0303003"}> arXiv:math/0303003
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alberto+S.+Cattaneo"}> Alberto S. Cattaneo
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juerg+Froehlich"} Juerg Froehlich
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological Field Theory Interpretation of String Topology
                %strong 240
                (2003) 397–421 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-003-0917-2"}> doi:10.1007/s00220-003-0917-2
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0202176"} arXiv:math/0202176
            %li#Tamanoi07
              %p
                Hirotaka Tamanoi,
                %em Loop coproducts in string topology and triviality of higher genus TQFT operations
                (2007) (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0706.1276"}> arXiv
                )
          %p
            The open-closed
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/HQFT"} HQFT
            in the presence of a single space-filling
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/brane"} brane
          %ul
            %li#Godin
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Veronique+Godin"}> Veronique Godin
              ,
              %em Higher string topology operations
              (2007) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0711.4859"}> arXiv:0711.4859
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            The generalization to multiple
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/branes"} branes
          %ul
            %li#Kupers11
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sander+Kupers"}> Sander Kupers
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em String topology operations
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://studenttheses.uu.nl/handle/20.500.12932/7283"} hdl:20.500.12932/7283
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Kupers-StringTopology.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Exposition of the perspective of regarding
            = succeed "-operations" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+topology"} string topology
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/TQFT"} TQFT
            of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+string"} topological string
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sigma+model"} sigma model
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+Cohen"}> Ralph Cohen
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Voronov"} Alexander Voronov
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Notes on String Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+Cohen"} Ralph Cohen
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kathryn+Hess"} Kathryn Hess
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Voronov"} Alexander Voronov
                (eds.):
                = succeed "," do
                  %em String topology and cyclic homology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0503625"} math.GT/05036259
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/3-7643-7388-1"} doi:10.1007/3-7643-7388-1
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://gen.lib.rus.ec/get?md5=adde9464705ede0fea6b435edb58fbe7"} pdf
            %li#Sullivan05SFT
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dennis+Sullivan"}> Dennis Sullivan
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Open and closed string field theory interpreted in classical algebraic topology
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ulrike+Tillmann"} Ulrike Tillmann
                (ed.):
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topology, Geometry and Quantum Field Theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511526398.014"} doi:10.1017/CBO9780511526398.014
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Sullivan-SFT.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dennis+Sullivan"}> Dennis Sullivan
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Sigma models and string topology
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leon+Takhtajan"} Leon Takhtajan
                (eds.):
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Graphs and Patterns in Mathematics and Theoretical Physics
                %strong 73
                (2005) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/pspum/073"}> doi:10.1090/pspum/073
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/1697823"} spire:1697823
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Sullivan-SigmaModels.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            For
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/target+space"} target space
            the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+space"} classifying space
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi B
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B G
            of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+Lie+group"} compact Lie group
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
            (such as a
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+group"} finite group
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kate+Gruher"}> Kate Gruher
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em String Topology of Classifying Spaces
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Gruher_FreeLoopSpaceOfClassifyingSpace.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                David Chataur,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luc+Menichi"} Luc Menichi
                %em String topology of classifying spaces
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0801.0174"}> arXiv:0801.0174
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://math.univ-angers.fr/perso/lmenichi/String_Classifiant09.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Richard+Hepworth"}> Richard Hepworth
                , Anssi Lahtinen:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On string topology of classifying spaces
              %p
                %strong 281
                (2015) 394-507 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1308.6169"}> arXiv:1308.6169
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aim.2015.03.022"} doi:10.1016/j.aim.2015.03.022
            %li
              %p
                Katsuhiko Kuribayashi,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luc+Menichi"} Luc Menichi
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Batalin–Vilkovisky Algebra in the String Topology of Classifying Spaces
                %strong 71
                4 (2019) 843-889 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.4153/CJM-2018-021-9"}> doi:10.4153/CJM-2018-021-9
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Arguments that this string-topology
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/HQFT"} HQFT
            should refine to a chain-level theory – a
            = succeed ":" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/TCFT"} TCFT
          %ul
            %li#Costello
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kevin+Costello"}> Kevin Costello
                ,
                %em
                  Topological conformal field theories and Calabi-Yau
                  = succeed "-categories" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msub
                            %mi A
                            %mn ∞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A_\infty
                (2004) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0412149"}> arXiv:0412149
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#Lurie
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                , ex. 4.2.16, rem. 4.2.17 in:
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/On+the+Classification+of+Topological+Field+Theories"} On the Classification of Topological Field Theories
                (2009)
          %p
            For the string product and the BV-operator this extension has been known early on, it yields a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+BV+algebra"} homotopy BV algebra
            considered in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Scott+Wilson"}> Scott Wilson
              , around page 101 of:
              %em On the Algebra and Geometry of a Manifold’s Chains and Cochains
              (2005) (
              %a{:href => "http://qcpages.qc.cuny.edu/~swilson/main.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            Evidence for the existence of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/TCFT"} TCFT
            version by exhibiting a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dg-category"} dg-category
            that looks like it ought to be the dg-category of string-topology
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/branes"} branes
            (hence ought to correspond to the TCFT under the suitable version of the
            = succeed "-version" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/TCFT"} TCFT
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cobordism+hypothesis"} cobordism hypothesis
          %ul
            %li#BlumbergCoheneTeleman09
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Blumberg"}> Andrew Blumberg
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+Cohen"} Ralph Cohen
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Constantin+Teleman"} Constantin Teleman
              = succeed "," do
                %em Open-closed field theories, string topology, and Hochschild homology
              = succeed "," do
                %em Alpine Perspectives on Algebraic Topology
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 504
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0906.5198"} arXiv:0906.5198
        .revisedby
